Adds gesture momentum to the transform, so that SDKs on top of the engine
stop each building their own engine for fling, friction, and bearing snap
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1705). A momentum
moves the camera from where it stands on each frame, so other commands can
change the fields that it leaves alone, and it pans in short screen steps,
so a fling travels evenly at any pitch.

